[statement]
A requested package's dependency whose best candidate forbids it takes its
next candidate (`a-later-name-gives-way-to-a-requested-name-its-best-candidate-forbids`):
`b` 2, requested, needs `e` and provides `w`, and `e` 2, the best
candidate for `e`, forbids `w`. apk takes `e` 1.

[repository]
P:e
V:2
D:!w

P:e
V:1

P:b
V:2
D:e
p:w=2

[request]
b

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install e 1
install b 2
